  ✓ clinic_fls: compiles through the same element vocabulary
  ✓ clinic_fls: every issue code is declared
  ✓ clinic_fls: the audit reports compliance as NOT_EVALUATED
  ✓ warehouse_fls: compiles through the same element vocabulary
  ✓ warehouse_fls: every issue code is declared
  ✓ warehouse_fls: the audit reports compliance as NOT_EVALUATED
  ✓ mixed_fls: compiles through the same element vocabulary
  ✓ mixed_fls: every issue code is declared
  ✓ mixed_fls: the audit reports compliance as NOT_EVALUATED
